\",\"value\":\"G+5P+17\"},{\"@type\":\"PropertyValue\",\"name\":\"Litigation\",\"value\":\"No\"}],\"brand\":{\"@type\":\"Brand\",\"name\":\"V Raheja Realty\"},\"broker\":{\"@type\":\"RealEstateAgent\",\"name\":\"Housiey\",\"url\":\"https://housiey.com\"}}20:T32ad,"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"{\n  \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\n  \"@type\": \"FAQPage\",\n  \"mainEntity\": [\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"Can I visit the sample flat of V Raheja La Serena?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"Yes, a sample flat is available for viewing. Currently, the 3BHK show flat is ready and can be visited. Book a free site visit through Housiey and our team will arrange everything.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"What is the expected possession date of V Raheja La Serena?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"The expected possession date is 01 December 2028 as per RERA. Construction is currently 65% complete as of August 6, 2026. Target possession is 01 December 2027.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"Is V Raheja La Serena RERA registered? What is its RERA number?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"Yes, it is RERA registered. The RERA number is P51800050593.You can verify it on the official RERA portal: https://maharerait.maharashtra.gov.in/public/project/view/44119\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"Is there any litigation against V Raheja La Serena?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"No, it has no pending litigation. All legal documents including the Commencement Certificate and Legal Title Report are available on Housiey for review before booking.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"What legal documents are available for V Raheja La Serena?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"The following legal documents are available on Housiey: Commencement Certificate, Legal Title Report, Proforma Allotment Letter, Proforma Sale Agreement. You can preview them directly on the project page or verify them independently on the official RERA portal using RERA number P51800050593.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"What amenities are available in V Raheja La Serena?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"This project offers 27+ amenities. Key external amenities include Swimming Pool, Fitness Deck, Sun Deck, Walking Track, and Gymnasium. Internal specifications include Modular Kitchen and Fire Fighting. The complete amenities list is available on Housiey.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"What are the monthly maintenance charges for V Raheja La Serena?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"Monthly maintenance details are available in the price sheet. You can download it from the project page on Housiey.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"What is the carpet area of a 2BHK in V Raheja La Serena?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"In V Raheja La Serena, the 2BHK units are available in the following carpet area options:• 715 sq. ft.• 725 sq. ft.• 765 sq. ft.Each configuration may differ slightly in layout, balcony size, or orientation. Our team can walk you through floor plans for each option during your consultation or site visit.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"What is the carpet area of a 3BHK in V Raheja La Serena?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"In V Raheja La Serena, the 3BHK units are available in the following carpet area options:• 1025 sq. ft.• 1150 sq. ft.Each configuration may differ slightly in layout, balcony size, or orientation. Our team can walk you through floor plans for each option during your consultation or site visit.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"What is the carpet area of a 4BHK in V Raheja La Serena?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"In V Raheja La Serena, the 4BHK units are available in the following carpet area options:• 1575 sq. ft.Each configuration may differ slightly in layout, balcony size, or orientation. Our team can walk you through floor plans for each option during your consultation or site visit.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"What is the all-inclusive price of a 2BHK in V Raheja La Serena?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"The all-inclusive price of a 2BHK in V Raheja La Serena starts from ₹2.67 Cr and varies depending on the carpet area and floor level you choose.\\n\\n• 715 sq. ft. – ₹2.67 Cr (all-inclusive)• 725 sq. ft. – ₹2.70 Cr (all-inclusive)• 765 sq. ft. – ₹2.76 Cr (all-inclusive)The price includes the base cost, applicable stamp duty, registration charges, GST, and possession charges. Final pricing may vary based on unit configuration, selected floor, and availability.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"What is the all-inclusive price of a 3BHK in V Raheja La Serena?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"The all-inclusive price of a 3BHK in V Raheja La Serena starts from ₹4.10 Cr and varies depending on the carpet area and floor level you choose.\\n\\n• 1025 sq. ft. – ₹4.10 Cr (all-inclusive)• 1150 sq. ft. – ₹4.56 Cr (all-inclusive)The price includes the base cost, applicable stamp duty, registration charges, GST, and possession charges. Final pricing may vary based on unit configuration, selected floor, and availability.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"What is the all-inclusive price of a 4BHK in V Raheja La Serena?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"The all-inclusive price of a 4BHK in V Raheja La Serena starts from ₹6.16 Cr and varies depending on the carpet area and floor level you choose.\\n\\n• 1575 sq. ft. – ₹6.16 Cr (all-inclusive)The price includes the base cost, applicable stamp duty, registration charges, GST, and possession charges. Final pricing may vary based on unit configuration, selected floor, and availability.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"What are the floor plans and configurations available in V Raheja La Serena?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"It is built across 2.4 acres with 7 towers with G+5P+17 floors. Each floor has 4 flats per floor, 2 lifts, 1 staircases. It is available in 2BHK/3BHK/4BHK configurations with carpet areas ranging from 715 to 1575 sq. ft.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"What type of parking is available in V Raheja La Serena?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"V Raheja La Serena provides dedicated car parking facilities for residents. The exact parking type and the number of spaces allotted per unit are mentioned in the Unit Plan, which you can download for free on the V Raheja La Serena project page on Housiey.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"Where is V Raheja La Serena located? What are the nearby landmarks?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"It is located at Off M.G. road, Patel Nagar, Kandivali West, Mumbai.Nearby landmarks include:• Kandivali Railway Station - 1.0km • DMart - 1.5km • Dahanukarwadi Metro Station - 1.6km \"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"What payment plans are available for V Raheja La Serena?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"The following payment plans are available:• CLP ( Construction Link plan) - Regular Standard Slabwise Payment  as per construction, Maximum loan possible up to 90%Note: In some cases, payment plan deviations can be considered based on your preferred terms. The final schedule is confirmed after your site visit.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"What is the minimum down payment required for V Raheja La Serena?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"The minimum down payment starts from ₹40.00 Lacs, inclusive of all taxes. EMI options are also available. Use the EMI calculator on the project page to check monthly instalments based on your loan amount and tenure.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"Is V Raheja La Serena approved by banks for home loans?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"Yes, it is approved by leading banks including Central Bank of India, Union Bank of India, Bank Of India, Bank Of Baroda, Citi Bank, Kotak Mahindra Bank, Axis Bank, State Bank Of India, ICICI Bank, HDFC BANK. The complete approved bank list is available in the Banks section on Housiey. Home loan eligibility depends on the bank's lending policy and your profile.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"Is there any brokerage when buying V Raheja La Serena through Housiey?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"No - Housiey follows a strict no-brokerage policy. You pay only the builder's official price - no commission, no hidden charges, and no middlemen. This applies to all projects listed on Housiey.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"Who is the developer of V Raheja La Serena?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"It is developed by V Raheja Realty, a trusted real estate brand with over 48 years of experience and more than 100 completed projects across Bangalore Rural, Bangalore Urban, Mumbai City and Mumbai suburban. \"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"Does V Raheja La Serena have CC and OC approvals?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"The Commencement Certificate is available. The Occupancy Certificate (OC) will be applied for closer to the possession date, as per standard regulatory timelines. All currently available documents are listed in the Documents section on Housiey.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"Can I book a site visit for V Raheja La Serena?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"Yes - book a free site visit through Housiey. We arrange a free Ola cab pickup and drop from your location.Alternatively, you can schedule an online project presentation directly by the builder from home. Both options are 100% free with no obligation to buy.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"Can NRIs buy a flat in V Raheja La Serena?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"Yes - NRIs can purchase this project under FEMA regulations. Payment can be made via NRE or NRO accounts. Home loans are available from Indian banks with a co-applicant. Housiey's team assists NRI buyers with documentation and Power of Attorney requirements remotely - 100% free.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"Why is V Raheja La Serena considered a good investment?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"Kandivali West is one of Mumbai's sought-after micro-markets with consistent property appreciation.This project by V Raheja Realty - with 48 years of experience - offers 2BHK/3BHK/4BHK at ₹2.67 Cr to ₹6.16 Cr, making it a strong long-term investment opportunity.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"Why should I buy V Raheja La Serena through Housiey instead of directly from the builder?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"Buying through Housiey gives you:(1) No brokerage - you pay the builder's exact price(2) Free Ola cab site visit(3) Online project presentation by the builder from home(4) Free legal consultation via Housiey Legal(5) Honest Pros \u0026 Cons review on every projectAll services are 100% free with no obligation.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"How can I download the price sheet or brochure of V Raheja La Serena?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"The price sheet and brochure for this project are available for free download on Housiey. Click the \\\"Price Sheet\\\" or \\\"Brochure\\\" button on the project page. No registration is required for instant download.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"What is Housiey's rating and how many customers have bought homes through Housiey?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"Housiey has a 4.8 rating on Google with 2,395+ reviews.Over 8,500 families have purchased homes through Housiey across 8+ cities with no brokerage and direct builder pricing. Housiey has conducted 1.2 lakh+ free site visits and facilitated over ₹8,000 crore worth of property transactions.\"\n      }\n    }\n  ]\n}"])</script><script>self.__n