t" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimage%2Ficons%2FRERA-number-icon.svg&amp;w=64&amp;q=75 1x" src="/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimage%2Ficons%2FRERA-number-icon.svg&amp;w=64&amp;q=75"/><div class="flex flex-col min-w-0 flex-1 overflow-hidden"><div class="font-bold text-[13px] md:text-sm text-[#234e70] underline"><span class="cursor-pointer hover:underline block truncate" data-state="closed" data-slot="tooltip-trigger">P51800050593</span></div><p class="text-[11px] md:text-xs text-gray-600 truncate">RERA NO.</p></div></div><div class="border shadow-[0px_0px_11.3px_0px_rgba(0,0,0,0.12)] p-2 flex items-center gap-2 min-w-0"><img alt="Possession Status" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="w-6 h-6 flex-shrink-0 object-contain" style="color:transparent" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimage%2Ficons%2Fpossession-status-icon.svg&amp;w=64&amp;q=75 1x" src="/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimage%2Ficons%2Fpossession-status-icon.svg&amp;w=64&amp;q=75"/><div class="flex flex-col min-w-0 flex-1 overflow-hidden"><div class="font-bold text-[13px] md:text-sm text-[#0E8744]"><span class="cursor-pointer hover:underline block truncate" data-state="closed" data-slot="tooltip-trigger">Mid Stage (1-2 yrs)</span></div><p class="text-[11px] md:text-xs text-gray-600 truncate">Possession Status</p></div></div><div class="border shadow-[0px_0px_11.3px_0px_rgba(0,0,0,0.12)] p-2 flex items-center gap-2 min-w-0"><img alt="Target Possession" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="w-6 h-6 flex-shrink-0 object-contain" style="color:transparent" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimage%2Ficons%2Ftarget-possession-icon.svg&amp;w=64&amp;q=75 1x" src="/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimage%2Ficons%2Ftarget-possession-icon.svg&amp;w=64&amp;q=75"/><div class="flex flex-col min-w-0 flex-1 overflow-hidden"><div class="font-bold text-[13px] md:text-sm text-[#0E8744]"><span class="cursor-pointer hover:underline block truncate" data-state="closed" data-slot="tooltip-trigger">Dec 2027</span></div><p class="text-[11px] md:text-xs text-gray-600 truncate">Target Possession</p></div></div><div class="border shadow-[0px_0px_11.3px_0px_rgba(0,0,0,0.12)] p-2 flex items-center gap-2 min-w-0"><img alt="RERA Possession" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="w-6 h-6 flex-shrink-0 object-contain" style="color:transparent" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimage%2Ficons%2FRERA-possession-icon.svg&amp;w=64&amp;q=75 1x" src="/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimage%2Ficons%2FRERA-possession-icon.svg&amp;w=64&amp;q=75"/><div class="flex flex-col min-w-0 flex-1 overflow-hidden"><div class="font-bold text-[13px] md:text-sm text-[#0E8744]"><span class="cursor-pointer hover:underline block truncate" data-state="closed" data-slot="tooltip-trigger">Dec 2028</span></div><p class="text-[11px] md:text-xs text-gray-600 truncate">RERA Possession</p></div></div><div class="border shadow-[0px_0px_11.3px_0px_rgba(0,0,0,0.12)] p-2 flex items-center gap-2 min-w-0"><img alt="Litigation" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="w-6 h-6 flex-shrink-0 object-contain" style="color:transparent" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimage%2Ficons%2Flitigation-icon.svg&amp;w=64&amp;q=75 1x" src="/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimage%2Ficons%2Flitigation-icon.svg&amp;w=64&amp;q=75"/><div class="flex flex-col min-w-0 flex-1 overflow-hidden"><div class="font-bold text-[13px] md:text-sm text-[#0E8744]"><span class="inline-block px-2 py-0 mt-0.5 rounded-md text-[11px] font-bold shadow-lg text-secondary border border-secondary bg-[#E7F3EC]">No</span></div><p class="text-[11px] md:text-xs text-gray-600 truncate">Litigation</p></div></div></div><div><h3 class="text-[13px] md:text-[14px] font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-2">About <!-- -->V Raheja La Serena</h3><div class="text-[12px] md:text-sm text-gray-700 leading-relaxed"><div class="overflow-hidden transition-[height] duration-500 ease-in-out"><p>V Raheja Kandivali West Project Overview<br/>V Raheja La Serena will be constructed on 2.40 acres of land parcel, 7 towers with G+5P+17 floors having 2 BHK, 3 BHK &amp; 4 BHK premium residences.<br/><br/>V Raheja La Serena location<br/>Project is located Off M.G. road, Patel Nagar, Kandivali West, Mumbai with -<br/>Kandivali Railway Station - 1.0km<br/>DMart - 1.5km<br/>Dahanukarwadi Metro Station - 1.6km<br/><br/>V Raheja La Serena Kandivali West Project Amenities<br/>First is Internal amenities -<br/>Vitrified Tiles, Earthquake Resistant, Granite Platform, Stainless Steel Sink, CCTV &amp; many more<br/><br/>V Raheja Realty Kandivali West External Amenities<br/>Project has 30+ amenities with likes of -<br/>Swimming pool<br/>Kid Pool<br/>Gym<br/>Yoga Studio<br/>Zen garden<br/>Indoor Games<br/>Party Deck &amp; Many More<br/><br/>V Raheja Realty La Serena Kandivali West Parking -<br/>Project has one type of car parking facility -<br/>1) Podium<br/><br/>V Raheja La Serena Possession -<br/>Rera Possession - December 2028<br/>Target Possession - December 2027<br/><br/>Carpet Area &amp; Floor Plan<br/>La Serena project has 2BHK, 3BHK &amp; 4BHK premium residences with -<br/>2BHK - (715 to 765) sqft<br/>3BHK - (1025 to 1150) sqft<br/>4BHK - 1575 sqft<br/><br/>V Raheja La Serena floor plan<br/>Tower floor plan will have 4 flats, 2 lifts &amp; 1 staircase on each floor<br/><br/>V Raheja La Serena Mumbai Prices &amp; its details can be found in the price section &amp; V Raheja La Serena Kandivali West brochure can be downloaded from the link mentionedd below. Project has been praised by the home buyers &amp; V Raheja Realty Kandivali West review is 4 out of 5 from over all the clients who have visited the site.</p></div></div></div></div></section></section><section id="location"><section id="location-section" class="w-full bg-white rounded-lg shadow"><div class="p-2 pl-3 bg-[#DEE4EA] flex items-center justify-between gap-2"><h2 class="font-jost text-[12px] md:text-[18px] font-[700] text-primary m-0 truncate flex min-w-0 flex-1 items-baseline gap-1"><span class="truncate min-w-0">V Raheja La Serena</span> <span class="whitespace-nowrap shrink-0">Location</span></h2></div><div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row px-4 py-2 gap-4"><div class="flex flex-col flex-1 gap-4"><div><p class="text-[12px] md:text-[14px] font-[400] text-[rgba(109, 109, 109, 1)] mb-1">Off M.G. road, Patel Nagar, Kandivali West, Mumbai</p><div class="py-1 flex "><ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1 my-1"><li><div class="text-[12px] md:text-[14px] flex items-center"><span class="font-[600] text-[#000000] rounded">Kandivali Railway Station - 1.0km</span></div></li><li><div class="text-[12px] md:text-[14px] flex items-center"><span class="font-[600] text-[#000000] rounded">DMart - 1.5km</span></div></li><li><div class="text-[12px] md:text-[14px] flex items-center"><span class="font-[600] text-[#000000] rounded">Dahanukarwadi Metro Station - 1.6km</span></div></li></ul></div></div><!--$!--><template data-dgst="BAILOUT_TO_CLIENT_SIDE_RENDERING"></template><div class="w-full h-[200px] bg-gray-200 rounded-lg animate-pulse"></div><!--/$--></div><div class="hidden md:block w-px bg-gray-300"></div><div class="flex-1"><div class="relative w-full h-[250px] md:h-full rounded-lg overflow-hidden cursor-pointer"><img alt="360 background" decoding="async" data-nimg="fill" class="object-cover object-center" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent" sizes="100vw" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimage%2F360-background-image.webp&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimage%2F360-background-image.webp&amp;w=768&amp;q=75 768w, /_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimage%2F360-background-image.webp&amp;w=1024&amp;q=75 1024w, /_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimage%2F360-background-image.webp&amp;w=1280&amp;q=75 1280w" src="/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimage%2F360-background-image.webp&amp;w=1280&amp;q=75"/><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-black/50"></div><div class="absolute top-3 left-3 opacity-90"><img alt="Housiey Logo" loading="lazy" width="120" height="40" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="object-contain" style="color:transparent" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimage%2Flogo1.png&amp;w=128&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimage%2Flogo1.png&amp;w=256&amp;q=75 2x" src="/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimage%2Flogo1.png&amp;w=256&amp;q=75"/></div><div class="absolute inset-0 flex items-center justify-center"><img alt="360" loading="lazy" width="60" height="60" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" style="color:transparent" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimage%2Ficons%2F360-tour-icon.png&amp;w=64&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimage%2Ficons%2F360-tour-icon.png&amp;w=128&amp;q=75 2x" src="/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimage%2Ficons%2F360-tour-icon.png&amp;w=128&amp;q=75"/></div></div></div></div></section></section><section id="video"><!--$--><section id="videos-section" class="w-full bg-white rounded-lg shadow"><div class="p-2 pl-3 bg-[#DEE4EA] flex items-center justify-between gap-2"><h2 class="font-jost text-[12px] md:text-[18px] font-[700] text-primary m-0 truncate flex min-w-0 flex-1 items-baseline gap-1"><span class="truncate min-w-0">V Raheja La Serena</span> <span class="whitespace-nowrap shrink-0">Videos</span></h2></div><div class="flex mt-1 gap-6 px-4 overflow-x-auto no-scrollbar"><button class="relative cursor-pointer py-1 text-[13px] md:text-[15px] transition border-b-2 border-[#0E8744] text-[#0E8744] font-semibold">3BHK Sample Flat</button></div><div class="px-4 py-4"></div></section><!--/$--></section><section id="pros-cons"><!--$--><section class="w-full bg-white rounded-lg shadow relative isolate"><div class="p-2 pl-3 bg-[#DEE4EA] flex items-center justify-between gap-2"><h2 class="font-jost text-[12px] md:text-[18px] font-[700] text-primary m-0 truncate flex min-w-0 flex-1 items-baseline gap-1"><span class="truncate min-w-0">V Raheja La Serena</span> <span class="whitespace-nowrap shrink-0">Pros &amp; Cons</span></h2></div><div class="relative pb-1"><div class="absolute inset-0 flex items-center justify-center z-10 backdrop-blur-[0.5px]"><button type="button" class="relative cursor-pointer bg-secondary rounded-full p-3 md:p-4 shadow-[0_4px_20px_rgba(0,0,0,0.2)] transition-all duration-300 ease-out hover:bg-primary hover:shadow-[0_0_20px_rgba(255,255,255,0.3)] active:scale-95"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-lock-keyhole text-white drop-shadow-[0_0_5px_rgba(255,255,255,0.6)] animate-pulse"><circle cx="12" cy="16" r="1"></circle><rect x="3" y="10" width="18" height="12" rx="2"></rect><path d="M7 10V7a5 5 0 0 1 10 0v3"></path></svg><span class="absolute inset-0 rounded-full border border-white/50 animate-ping opacity-30"></span></button></div><div class="pointer-events-none blur-[1px] brightness-75 select-none"><div class="cursor-pointer mb-4" role="button" aria-disabled="true"><div class="p-3 mt-4 mb-0 mx-4 rounded-sm flex items-center justify-between" style="background-color:rgba(212, 234, 212, 1);color:#234E70"><div class="flex items-center gap-2"><img alt="Pros-icon" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="ml-2 object-contain" style="color:transparent" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimage%2Ficons%2Fthumbs-up-icon.svg&amp;w=64&amp;q=75 1x" src="/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimage%2Ficons%2Fthumbs-up-icon.svg&amp;w=64&amp;q=75"/><p class="m-0 text-[14px] md:text-[16px] font-[700]">Pros</p></div><img alt="toggle-arrow" loading="lazy" width="16" height="16" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="transition-transform duration-300 object-contain" style="color:transparent" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimage%2Ficons%2Farrow-down-icon.svg&amp;w=64&amp;q=75 1x" src="/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimage%2Ficons%2Farrow-down-icon.svg&amp;w=64&amp;q=75"/></div><div class="overflow-hidden transition-all duration-500" style="max-height:0px"><div class="pl-4 pr-4 pt-1 pb-2 mx-4 my-2 bg-white text-[13px] md:text-[14px] relative rounded"><div><div><div class="mb-2 flex gap-2"><span class="font-bold">1<!-- -->.</span><span>The project is situated in a prime location near S.V. Road, offering excellent connectivity to Kandivali Railway Station, Dahanukarwadi Metro Station, and nearby malls.</span></div><div class="mb-2 flex gap-2"><span class="font-bold">2<!-- -->.</span><span>The project offers generously sized apartments — 2BHK (765 sq. ft.), 3BHK (1150 sq. ft.), and 4BHK (1575 sq. ft.) — which are rare to find in today’s market where most developers focus on compact layouts. If you value spacious living, this project is an ideal choice.</span></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="cursor-pointer mb-4" role="button" aria-disabled="true"><div class="p-3 mt-4 mb-0 mx-4 rounded-sm flex items-center justify-between" style="background-color:rgba(255, 207, 207, 1);color:#234E70"><div class="flex items-center gap-2"><img alt="Cons-icon" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="ml-2 object-contain" style="color:transparent" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimage%2Ficons%2Fthumbs-down-icon.svg&amp;w=64&amp;q=75 1x" src="/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimage%2Ficons%2Fthumbs-down-icon.svg&amp;w=64&amp;q=75"/><p class="m-0 text-[14px] md:text-[16px] font-[700]">Cons</p></div><img alt="toggle-arrow" loading="lazy" width="16" height="16" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="transition-transform duration-300 object-contain" style="color:transparent" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimage%2Ficons%2Farrow-down-icon.svg&amp;w=64&amp;q=75 1x" src="/_next/image?url=%2Fassets%2Fimage%2Ficons%2Farrow-down-icon.svg&amp;w=64&amp;q=75"/></div><div class="overflow-hidden transition-all duration-500" style="max-height:0px"><div class="pl-4 pr-4 pt-1 pb-2 mx-4 my-2 bg-white text-[13px] md:text-[14px] relative rounded"><div><div><div class="mb-2 flex gap-2"><span class="font-bold">1<!-- -->.</span><span>Even with such large carpet areas, balconies are available only on the higher floors. So, if a deck is your preference, you should consider opting for a higher floor—depending on your budget.</span></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><!--/$--></section><section id="PlansAndAmenities"><section id="amenities"><!--$--><section class="w-full bg-white rounded-lg shadow"><div class="p-2 pl-3 bg-[#DEE4EA] flex items-center justify-between gap-2"><h2 class="font-jost text-[12px] md:text-[18px] font-[700] text-primary m-0 truncate flex min-w-0 flex-1 items-baseline gap-1"><span class="truncate min-w-0">V Raheja La Serena</span> <span class="whitespace-nowrap shrink-0">Amenities</span></h2></div><div class="py-2 px-4"><h3 class="text-[12px] md:text-[13px] font-bold text-primary mb-2">Internal Amenities</h3><div class="grid grid-cols-3 md:grid-cols-8 gap-2"><div class=" border border-[#CFCFCF] flex flex-col items-center justify-center rounded-[6px] px-1 py-2 h-[80px] md:h-auto md:aspect-video "><div class="flex items-center justify-center h-[30px] w-[30px] my-1"><img alt="Vitrified Tiles" loading="lazy" width="30" height="30" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="object-contain max-h-[30px]" style="color:transparent" srcSet="https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/amenities/1652438961711-img.webp 1x" src="https://resources.housiey.com/admin/uploads/amenities/1652438961711-img.webp"/></div><p class="text-[12px] font-semibold text-gray-800 text-center truncate w-full mt-1.5 md:mt-0" title="Vitrified Tiles">Vitrified Tiles</p></div><div class=" border border-[#CFCFCF] flex flex-col items-center justify-center rounded-[6px] px-1 py-2 h-[80px] md:h-auto md:aspect-video "><div class="flex items-center justify-center h-[30px] w-[30px] my-1"><img alt="Granite Kitchen Platform" loading="lazy" w