n><span class="text-[#234e70] font-bold md:font-semibold text-[12px] md:text-base order-2 md:order-1 md:after:content-[&#x27;:&#x27;] after:content-[&#x27;&#x27;]">Experience</span></div><div class="flex bg-[#F4F4F4] md:items-center px-3.5 py-3 md:py-2 md:rounded-full gap-2 flex-col md:flex-row items-center text-center md:text-left"><span class="text-green-600 font-bold md:text-base order-1 md:order-2">100</span><span class="text-[#234e70] font-bold md:font-semibold text-[12px] md:text-base order-2 md:order-1 md:after:content-[&#x27;:&#x27;] after:content-[&#x27;&#x27;] whitespace-nowrap">Total Projects</span></div><div class="flex bg-[#F4F4F4] md:items-center px-2 md:px-3.5 py-3 md:py-2 rounded-xs md:rounded-full gap-2 flex-col md:flex-row items-center text-center md:text-left"><span class="text-green-600 font-bold md:text-base order-1 md:order-2">15K<!-- -->+</span><span class="text-[#234e70] font-bold md:font-semibold text-[12px] md:text-base whitespace-nowrap order-2 md:order-1 md:after:content-[&#x27;:&#x27;] after:content-[&#x27;&#x27;]">Happy Families</span></div></div><div class="flex-1 space-y-4"><div class="text-[12px] md:text-sm text-gray-700 leading-relaxed"><div class="overflow-hidden transition-[height] duration-500 ease-in-out">Welcome to V Raheja Realty, a leading real estate company founded by Vijay Raheja, an accomplished Architect from the University of Texas, Austin. With his extensive experience in the industry, Vijay Raheja has played a pivotal role in making the Raheja name a staple in the real estate industry.
V Raheja Realty has a rich legacy Over 4 Decades, built on the trust and belief of its customers and stakeholders . We are one of Mumbai’s leading real estate Developer &amp; has constructed several Residential, Commercial and Hotel projects spread across Mumbai &amp; Bangalore. Some of the land mark projects being Raheja Chambers Nariman Point , Mumbai , J.W. Marriott Juhu Mumbai , S. L. Raheja Hospital Mahim Mumbai , Arya Vidya Mandir School JVPD Mumbai, J. W. Marriott UB City ,Bangalore , Pebble Bay Bangalore and many more.</div></div><a href="/builder/v-raheja-realty"><button data-slot="button" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 whitespace-nowrap disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 [&amp;_svg]:pointer-events-none [&amp;_svg:not([class*=&#x27;size-&#x27;])]:size-4 shrink-0 [&amp;_svg]:shrink-0 outline-none focus-visible:border-ring focus-visible:ring-ring/50 focus-visible:ring-[3px] aria-invalid:ring-destructive/20 dark:aria-invalid:ring-destructive/40 aria-invalid:border-destructive cursor-pointer h-9 has-[&gt;svg]:px-3 bg-[#0e8744] hover:bg-[#0e8744] text-white text-[13px] md:text-base font-medium px-5 py-2 rounded-lg shadow-sm transition">View All Projects Now !</button></a></div></div></section><!--/$--></section><section id="faq"><!--$--><section class="w-full bg-white shadow h-[549px] md:h-[450px] flex flex-col mb-4"><div class="p-2 pl-3 bg-[#DEE4EA] flex items-center justify-between gap-2"><h2 class="font-jost text-[12px] md:text-[18px] font-[700] text-primary m-0 truncate min-w-0">Frequently Asked Question</h2></div><div class="w-full px-2.5 md:px-6 flex-1 pb-4 overflow-y-auto custom-scrollbar"><div data-slot="accordion" class="mt-4 space-y-2.5" data-orientation="vertical"><div data-state="open" data-orientation="vertical" data-slot="accordion-item" class="last:border-b-0 rounded shadow-sm border border-gray-200"><h3 data-orientation="vertical" data-state="open" class="flex"><button type="button" aria-controls="radix-«R46mqm6ferb5lb»" aria-expanded="true" data-state="open" data-orientation="vertical" id="radix-«R6mqm6ferb5lb»" data-slot="accordion-trigger" class="focus-visible:border-ring focus-visible:ring-ring/50 flex-1 gap-4 text-left outline-none hover:underline focus-visible:ring-[3px] disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 [&amp;[data-state=open]&gt;svg]:rotate-180 !no-underline bg-[#DEE4EA] hover:brightness-105 transition px-4 py-1.5 text-[#234e70] font-semibold text-[14px] font-sans flex justify-between items-center [&amp;&gt;svg]:text-[#234e70] [&amp;&gt;svg]:w-4 [&amp;&gt;svg]:h-4 rounded-none cursor-pointer" data-radix-collection-item="">Can I visit the sample flat of V Raheja La Serena?<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down text-muted-foreground pointer-events-none size-4 shrink-0 translate-y-0.5 transition-transform duration-200"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></button></h3><div data-state="open" id="radix-«R46mqm6ferb5lb»" role="region" aria-labelledby="radix-«R6mqm6ferb5lb»" data-orientation="vertical" data-slot="accordion-content" class="overflow-hidden text-sm data-[state=closed]:hidden" style="--radix-accordion-content-height:var(--radix-collapsible-content-height);--radix-accordion-content-width:var(--radix-collapsible-content-width)"><div class="bg-white px-4 py-1.5 text-[12px] md:text-sm font-normal leading-relaxed font-sans text-gray-700"><div>Yes, a sample flat is available for viewing. Currently, the 3BHK show flat is ready and can be visited. Book a free site visit through Housiey and our team will arrange everything.</div></div></div></div><div data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical" data-slot="accordion-item" class="last:border-b-0 rounded shadow-sm border border-gray-200"><h3 data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed" class="flex"><button type="button" aria-expanded="false" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical" id="radix-«Ramqm6ferb5lb»" data-slot="accordion-trigger" class="focus-visible:border-ring focus-visible:ring-ring/50 flex-1 gap-4 text-left outline-none hover:underline focus-visible:ring-[3px] disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 [&amp;[data-state=open]&gt;svg]:rotate-180 !no-underline bg-[#DEE4EA] hover:brightness-105 transition px-4 py-1.5 text-[#234e70] font-semibold text-[14px] font-sans flex justify-between items-center [&amp;&gt;svg]:text-[#234e70] [&amp;&gt;svg]:w-4 [&amp;&gt;svg]:h-4 rounded-none cursor-pointer" data-radix-collection-item="">What is the expected possession date of V Raheja La Serena?<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down text-muted-foreground pointer-events-none size-4 shrink-0 translate-y-0.5 transition-transform duration-200"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></button></h3><div data-state="closed" id="radix-«R4amqm6ferb5lb»" role="region" aria-labelledby="radix-«Ramqm6ferb5lb»" data-orientation="vertical" data-slot="accordion-content" class="overflow-hidden text-sm data-[state=closed]:hidden" style="--radix-accordion-content-height:var(--radix-collapsible-content-height);--radix-accordion-content-width:var(--radix-collapsible-content-width)"><div class="bg-white px-4 py-1.5 text-[12px] md:text-sm font-normal leading-relaxed font-sans text-gray-700"><div>The expected possession date is <b>01 December 2028</b> as per RERA. Construction is currently <b>65%</b> complete as of August 6, 2026. Target possession is <b>01 December 2027</b>.</div></div></div></div><div data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical" data-slot="accordion-item" class="last:border-b-0 rounded shadow-sm border border-gray-200"><h3 data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed" class="flex"><button type="button" aria-expanded="false" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical" id="radix-«Remqm6ferb5lb»" data-slot="accordion-trigger" class="focus-visible:border-ring focus-visible:ring-ring/50 flex-1 gap-4 text-left outline-none hover:underline focus-visible:ring-[3px] disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 [&amp;[data-state=open]&gt;svg]:rotate-180 !no-underline bg-[#DEE4EA] hover:brightness-105 transition px-4 py-1.5 text-[#234e70] font-semibold text-[14px] font-sans flex justify-between items-center [&amp;&gt;svg]:text-[#234e70] [&amp;&gt;svg]:w-4 [&amp;&gt;svg]:h-4 rounded-none cursor-pointer" data-radix-collection-item="">Is V Raheja La Serena RERA registered? What is its RERA number?<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down text-muted-foreground pointer-events-none size-4 shrink-0 translate-y-0.5 transition-transform duration-200"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></button></h3><div data-state="closed" id="radix-«R4emqm6ferb5lb»" role="region" aria-labelledby="radix-«Remqm6ferb5lb»" data-orientation="vertical" data-slot="accordion-content" class="overflow-hidden text-sm data-[state=closed]:hidden" style="--radix-accordion-content-height:var(--radix-collapsible-content-height);--radix-accordion-content-width:var(--radix-collapsible-content-width)"><div class="bg-white px-4 py-1.5 text-[12px] md:text-sm font-normal leading-relaxed font-sans text-gray-700"><div>Yes, it is RERA registered. The RERA number is <b>P51800050593</b>.<br>You can verify it on the official RERA portal: <a href="https://maharerait.maharashtra.gov.in/public/project/view/44119" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="color: #0066cc; text-decoration: underline;">https://maharerait.maharashtra.gov.in/public/project/view/44119</a></div></div></div></div><div data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical" data-slot="accordion-item" class="last:border-b-0 rounded shadow-sm border border-gray-200"><h3 data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed" class="flex"><button type="button" aria-expanded="false" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical" id="radix-«Rimqm6ferb5lb»" data-slot="accordion-trigger" class="focus-visible:border-ring focus-visible:ring-ring/50 flex-1 gap-4 text-left outline-none hover:underline focus-visible:ring-[3px] disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 [&amp;[data-state=open]&gt;svg]:rotate-180 !no-underline bg-[#DEE4EA] hover:brightness-105 transition px-4 py-1.5 text-[#234e70] font-semibold text-[14px] font-sans flex justify-between items-center [&amp;&gt;svg]:text-[#234e70] [&amp;&gt;svg]:w-4 [&amp;&gt;svg]:h-4 rounded-none cursor-pointer" data-radix-collection-item="">Is there any litigation against V Raheja La Serena?<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down text-muted-foreground pointer-events-none size-4 shrink-0 translate-y-0.5 transition-transform duration-200"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></button></h3><div data-state="closed" id="radix-«R4imqm6ferb5lb»" role="region" aria-labelledby="radix-«Rimqm6ferb5lb»" data-orientation="vertical" data-slot="accordion-content" class="overflow-hidden text-sm data-[state=closed]:hidden" style="--radix-accordion-content-height:var(--radix-collapsible-content-height);--radix-accordion-content-width:var(--radix-collapsible-content-width)"><div class="bg-white px-4 py-1.5 text-[12px] md:text-sm font-normal leading-relaxed font-sans text-gray-700"><div>No, it has no pending litigation. All legal documents including the Commencement Certificate and Legal Title Report are available on Housiey for review before booking.</div></div></div></div><div data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical" data-slot="accordion-item" class="last:border-b-0 rounded shadow-sm border border-gray-200"><h3 data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed" class="flex"><button type="button" aria-expanded="false" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical" id="radix-«Rmmqm6ferb5lb»" data-slot="accordion-trigger" class="focus-visible:border-ring focus-visible:ring-ring/50 flex-1 gap-4 text-left outline-none hover:underline focus-visible:ring-[3px] disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 [&amp;[data-state=open]&gt;svg]:rotate-180 !no-underline bg-[#DEE4EA] hover:brightness-105 transition px-4 py-1.5 text-[#234e70] font-semibold text-[14px] font-sans flex justify-between items-center [&amp;&gt;svg]:text-[#234e70] [&amp;&gt;svg]:w-4 [&amp;&gt;svg]:h-4 rounded-none cursor-pointer" data-radix-collection-item="">What legal documents are available for V Raheja La Serena?<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down text-muted-foreground pointer-events-none size-4 shrink-0 translate-y-0.5 transition-transform duration-200"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></button></h3><div data-state="closed" id="radix-«R4mmqm6ferb5lb»" role="region" aria-labelledby="radix-«Rmmqm6ferb5lb»" data-orientation="vertical" data-slot="accordion-content" class="overflow-hidden text-sm data-[state=closed]:hidden" style="--radix-accordion-content-height:var(--radix-collapsible-content-height);--radix-accordion-content-width:var(--radix-collapsible-content-width)"><div class="bg-white px-4 py-1.5 text-[12px] md:text-sm font-normal leading-relaxed font-sans text-gray-700"><div>The following legal documents are available on Housiey: <b>Commencement Certificate</b>, <b>Legal Title Report</b>, <b>Proforma Allotment Letter</b>, <b>Proforma Sale Agreement</b>. You can preview them directly on the project page or verify them independently on the official RERA portal using RERA number <b>P51800050593</b>.</div></div></div></div><div data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical" data-slot="accordion-item" class="last:border-b-0 rounded shadow-sm border border-gray-200"><h3 data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed" class="flex"><button type="button" aria-expanded="false" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical" id="radix-«Rqmqm6ferb5lb»" data-slot="accordion-trigger" class="focus-visible:border-ring focus-visible:ring-ring/50 flex-1 gap-4 text-left outline-none hover:underline focus-visible:ring-[3px] disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 [&amp;[data-state=open]&gt;svg]:rotate-180 !no-underline bg-[#DEE4EA] hover:brightness-105 transition px-4 py-1.5 text-[#234e70] font-semibold text-[14px] font-sans flex justify-between items-center [&amp;&gt;svg]:text-[#234e70] [&amp;&gt;svg]:w-4 [&amp;&gt;svg]:h-4 rounded-none cursor-pointer" data-radix-collection-item="">What amenities are available in V Raheja La Serena?<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down text-muted-foreground pointer-events-none size-4 shrink-0 translate-y-0.5 transition-transform duration-200"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></button></h3><div data-state="closed" id="radix-«R4qmqm6ferb5lb»" role="region" aria-labelledby="radix-«Rqmqm6ferb5lb»" data-orientation="vertical" data-slot="accordion-content" class="overflow-hidden text-sm data-[state=closed]:hidden" style="--radix-accordion-content-height:var(--radix-collapsible-content-height);--radix-accordion-content-width:var(--radix-collapsible-content-width)"><div class="bg-white px-4 py-1.5 text-[12px] md:text-sm font-normal leading-relaxed font-sans text-gray-700"><div>This project offers <b>27+</b> amenities. Key external amenities include Swimming Pool, Fitness Deck, Sun Deck, Walking Track, and Gymnasium.<br> Internal specifications include Modular Kitchen and Fire Fighting. The complete amenities list is available on Housiey.</div></div></div></div><div data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical" data-slot="accordion-item" class="last:border-b-0 rounded shadow-sm border border-gray-200"><h3 data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed" class="flex"><button type="button" aria-expanded="false" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical" id="radix-«Rumqm6ferb5lb»" data-slot="accordion-trigger" class="focus-visible:border-ring focus-visible:ring-ring/50 flex-1 gap-4 text-left outline-none hover:underline focus-visible:ring-[3px] disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 [&amp;[data-state=open]&gt;svg]:rotate-180 !no-underline bg-[#DEE4EA] hover:brightness-105 transition px-4 py-1.5 text-[#234e70] font-semibold text-[14px] font-sans flex justify-between items-center [&amp;&gt;svg]:text-[#234e70] [&amp;&gt;svg]:w-4 [&amp;&gt;svg]:h-4 rounded-none cursor-pointer" data-radix-collection-item="">What are the monthly maintenance charges for V Raheja La Serena?<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down text-muted-foreground pointer-events-none size-4 shrink-0 translate-y-0.5 transition-transform duration-200"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></button></h3><div data-state="closed" id="radix-«R4umqm6ferb5lb»" role="region" aria-labelledby="radix-«Rumqm6ferb5lb»" data-orientation="vertical" data-slot="accordion-content" class="overflow-hidden text-sm data-[state=closed]:hidden" style="--radix-accordion-content-height:var(--radix-collapsible-content-height);--radix-accordion-content-width:var(--radix-collapsible-content-width)"><div class="bg-white px-4 py-1.5 text-[12px] md:text-sm font-normal leading-relaxed font-sans text-gray-700"><div>Monthly maintenance details are available in the price sheet. You can download it from the project page on Housiey.</div></div></div></div><div data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical" data-slot="accordion-item" class="last:border-b-0 rounded shadow-sm border border-gray-200"><h3 data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed" class="flex"><button type="button" aria-expanded="false" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical" id="radix-«R12mqm6ferb5lb»" data-slot="accordion-trigger" class="focus-visible:border-ring focus-visible:ring-ring/50 flex-1 gap-4 text-left outline-none hover:underline focus-visible:ring-[3px] disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 [&amp;[data-state=open]&gt;svg]:rotate-180 !no-underline bg-[#DEE4EA] hover:brightness-105 transition px-4 py-1.5 text-[#234e70] font-semibold text-[14px] font-sans flex justify-between items-center [&amp;&gt;svg]:text-[#234e70] [&amp;&gt;svg]:w-4 [&amp;&gt;svg]:h-4 rounded-none cursor-pointer" data-radix-collection-item="">What is the carpet area of a 2BHK in V Raheja La Serena?<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down text-muted-foreground pointer-events-none size-4 shrink-0 translate-y-0.5 transition-transform duration-200"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></button></h3><div data-state="closed" id="radix-«R52mqm6ferb5lb»" role="region" aria-labelledby="radix-«R12mqm6ferb5lb»" data-orientation="vertical" data-slot="accordion-content" class="overflow-hidden text-sm data-[state=closed]:hidden" style="--radix-accordion-content-height:var(--radix-collapsible-content-height);--radix-accordion-content-width:var(--radix-collapsible-content-width)"><div class="bg-white px-4 py-1.5 text-[12px] md:text-sm font-normal leading-relaxed font-sans text-gray-700"><div>In V Raheja La Serena, the 2BHK units are available in the following carpet area options:<br>• <b>715 sq. ft.</b><br>• <b>725 sq. ft.</b><br>• <b>765 sq. ft.</b><br>Each configuration may differ slightly in layout, balcony size, or orientation. Our team can walk you through floor plans for each option during your consultation or site visit.</div></div></div></div><div data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical" data-slot="accordion-item" class="last:border-b-0 rounded shadow-sm border border-gray-200"><h3 data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed" class="flex"><button type="button" aria-expanded="false" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical" id="radix-«R16mqm6ferb5lb»" data-slot="accordion-trigger" class="focus-visible:border-ring focus-visible:ring-ring/50 flex-1 gap-4 text-left outline-none hover:underline focus-visible:ring-[3px] disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 [&amp;[data-state=open]&gt;svg]:rotate-180 !no-underline bg-[#DEE4EA] hover:brightness-105 transition px-4 py-1.5 text-[#234e70] font-semibold text-[14px] font-sans flex justify-between items-center [&amp;&gt;svg]:text-[#234e70] [&amp;&gt;svg]:w-4 [&amp;&gt;svg]:h-4 rounded-none cursor-pointer" data-radix-collection-item="">What is the carpet area of a 3BHK in V Raheja La Serena?<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down text-muted-foreground pointer-events-none size-4 shrink-0 translate-y-0.5 transition-transform duration-200"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></button></h3><div data-state="closed" id="radix-«R56mqm6ferb5lb»" role="region" aria-labelledby="radix-«R16mqm6ferb5lb»" data-orientation="vertical" data-slot="accordion-content" class="overflow-hidden text-sm data-[state=closed]:hidden" style="--radix-accordion-content-height:var(--radix-collapsible-content-height);--radix-accordion-content-width:var(--radix-collapsible-content-width)"><div class="bg-white px-4 py-1.5 text-[12px] md:text-sm font-normal leading-relaxed font-s