-width:var(--radix-collapsible-content-width)"><div class="bg-white px-4 py-1.5 text-[12px] md:text-sm font-normal leading-relaxed font-sans text-gray-700"><div>In V Raheja La Serena, the 4BHK units are available in the following carpet area options:<br>• <b>1575 sq. ft.</b><br>Each configuration may differ slightly in layout, balcony size, or orientation. Our team can walk you through floor plans for each option during your consultation or site visit.</div></div></div></div><div data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical" data-slot="accordion-item" class="last:border-b-0 rounded shadow-sm border border-gray-200"><h3 data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed" class="flex"><button type="button" aria-expanded="false" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical" id="radix-«R1emqm6ferb5lb»" data-slot="accordion-trigger" class="focus-visible:border-ring focus-visible:ring-ring/50 flex-1 gap-4 text-left outline-none hover:underline focus-visible:ring-[3px] disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 [&amp;[data-state=open]&gt;svg]:rotate-180 !no-underline bg-[#DEE4EA] hover:brightness-105 transition px-4 py-1.5 text-[#234e70] font-semibold text-[14px] font-sans flex justify-between items-center [&amp;&gt;svg]:text-[#234e70] [&amp;&gt;svg]:w-4 [&amp;&gt;svg]:h-4 rounded-none cursor-pointer" data-radix-collection-item="">What is the all-inclusive price of a 2BHK in V Raheja La Serena?<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down text-muted-foreground pointer-events-none size-4 shrink-0 translate-y-0.5 transition-transform duration-200"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></button></h3><div data-state="closed" id="radix-«R5emqm6ferb5lb»" role="region" aria-labelledby="radix-«R1emqm6ferb5lb»" data-orientation="vertical" data-slot="accordion-content" class="overflow-hidden text-sm data-[state=closed]:hidden" style="--radix-accordion-content-height:var(--radix-collapsible-content-height);--radix-accordion-content-width:var(--radix-collapsible-content-width)"><div class="bg-white px-4 py-1.5 text-[12px] md:text-sm font-normal leading-relaxed font-sans text-gray-700"><div>The all-inclusive price of a 2BHK in V Raheja La Serena starts from <b>₹2.67 Cr</b> and varies depending on the carpet area and floor level you choose.

<br>• <b>715 sq. ft.</b> – ₹2.67 Cr (all-inclusive)<br>• <b>725 sq. ft.</b> – ₹2.70 Cr (all-inclusive)<br>• <b>765 sq. ft.</b> – ₹2.76 Cr (all-inclusive)<br>The price includes the base cost, applicable stamp duty, registration charges, GST, and possession charges. Final pricing may vary based on unit configuration, selected floor, and availability.</div></div></div></div><div data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical" data-slot="accordion-item" class="last:border-b-0 rounded shadow-sm border border-gray-200"><h3 data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed" class="flex"><button type="button" aria-expanded="false" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical" id="radix-«R1imqm6ferb5lb»" data-slot="accordion-trigger" class="focus-visible:border-ring focus-visible:ring-ring/50 flex-1 gap-4 text-left outline-none hover:underline focus-visible:ring-[3px] disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 [&amp;[data-state=open]&gt;svg]:rotate-180 !no-underline bg-[#DEE4EA] hover:brightness-105 transition px-4 py-1.5 text-[#234e70] font-semibold text-[14px] font-sans flex justify-between items-center [&amp;&gt;svg]:text-[#234e70] [&amp;&gt;svg]:w-4 [&amp;&gt;svg]:h-4 rounded-none cursor-pointer" data-radix-collection-item="">What is the all-inclusive price of a 3BHK in V Raheja La Serena?<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down text-muted-foreground pointer-events-none size-4 shrink-0 translate-y-0.5 transition-transform duration-200"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></button></h3><div data-state="closed" id="radix-«R5imqm6ferb5lb»" role="region" aria-labelledby="radix-«R1imqm6ferb5lb»" data-orientation="vertical" data-slot="accordion-content" class="overflow-hidden text-sm data-[state=closed]:hidden" style="--radix-accordion-content-height:var(--radix-collapsible-content-height);--radix-accordion-content-width:var(--radix-collapsible-content-width)"><div class="bg-white px-4 py-1.5 text-[12px] md:text-sm font-normal leading-relaxed font-sans text-gray-700"><div>The all-inclusive price of a 3BHK in V Raheja La Serena starts from <b>₹4.10 Cr</b> and varies depending on the carpet area and floor level you choose.

<br>• <b>1025 sq. ft.</b> – ₹4.10 Cr (all-inclusive)<br>• <b>1150 sq. ft.</b> – ₹4.56 Cr (all-inclusive)<br>The price includes the base cost, applicable stamp duty, registration charges, GST, and possession charges. Final pricing may vary based on unit configuration, selected floor, and availability.</div></div></div></div><div data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical" data-slot="accordion-item" class="last:border-b-0 rounded shadow-sm border border-gray-200"><h3 data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed" class="flex"><button type="button" aria-expanded="false" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical" id="radix-«R1mmqm6ferb5lb»" data-slot="accordion-trigger" class="focus-visible:border-ring focus-visible:ring-ring/50 flex-1 gap-4 text-left outline-none hover:underline focus-visible:ring-[3px] disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 [&amp;[data-state=open]&gt;svg]:rotate-180 !no-underline bg-[#DEE4EA] hover:brightness-105 transition px-4 py-1.5 text-[#234e70] font-semibold text-[14px] font-sans flex justify-between items-center [&amp;&gt;svg]:text-[#234e70] [&amp;&gt;svg]:w-4 [&amp;&gt;svg]:h-4 rounded-none cursor-pointer" data-radix-collection-item="">What is the all-inclusive price of a 4BHK in V Raheja La Serena?<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down text-muted-foreground pointer-events-none size-4 shrink-0 translate-y-0.5 transition-transform duration-200"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></button></h3><div data-state="closed" id="radix-«R5mmqm6ferb5lb»" role="region" aria-labelledby="radix-«R1mmqm6ferb5lb»" data-orientation="vertical" data-slot="accordion-content" class="overflow-hidden text-sm data-[state=closed]:hidden" style="--radix-accordion-content-height:var(--radix-collapsible-content-height);--radix-accordion-content-width:var(--radix-collapsible-content-width)"><div class="bg-white px-4 py-1.5 text-[12px] md:text-sm font-normal leading-relaxed font-sans text-gray-700"><div>The all-inclusive price of a 4BHK in V Raheja La Serena starts from <b>₹6.16 Cr</b> and varies depending on the carpet area and floor level you choose.

<br>• <b>1575 sq. ft.</b> – ₹6.16 Cr (all-inclusive)<br>The price includes the base cost, applicable stamp duty, registration charges, GST, and possession charges. Final pricing may vary based on unit configuration, selected floor, and availability.</div></div></div></div><div data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical" data-slot="accordion-item" class="last:border-b-0 rounded shadow-sm border border-gray-200"><h3 data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed" class="flex"><button type="button" aria-expanded="false" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical" id="radix-«R1qmqm6ferb5lb»" data-slot="accordion-trigger" class="focus-visible:border-ring focus-visible:ring-ring/50 flex-1 gap-4 text-left outline-none hover:underline focus-visible:ring-[3px] disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 [&amp;[data-state=open]&gt;svg]:rotate-180 !no-underline bg-[#DEE4EA] hover:brightness-105 transition px-4 py-1.5 text-[#234e70] font-semibold text-[14px] font-sans flex justify-between items-center [&amp;&gt;svg]:text-[#234e70] [&amp;&gt;svg]:w-4 [&amp;&gt;svg]:h-4 rounded-none cursor-pointer" data-radix-collection-item="">What are the floor plans and configurations available in V Raheja La Serena?<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down text-muted-foreground pointer-events-none size-4 shrink-0 translate-y-0.5 transition-transform duration-200"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></button></h3><div data-state="closed" id="radix-«R5qmqm6ferb5lb»" role="region" aria-labelledby="radix-«R1qmqm6ferb5lb»" data-orientation="vertical" data-slot="accordion-content" class="overflow-hidden text-sm data-[state=closed]:hidden" style="--radix-accordion-content-height:var(--radix-collapsible-content-height);--radix-accordion-content-width:var(--radix-collapsible-content-width)"><div class="bg-white px-4 py-1.5 text-[12px] md:text-sm font-normal leading-relaxed font-sans text-gray-700"><div>It is built across <b>2.4 acres</b> with <b>7</b> towers with <b>G+5P+17</b> floors. Each floor has <b>4</b> flats per floor, <b>2</b> lifts, <b>1</b> staircases. It is available in <b>2BHK/3BHK/4BHK</b> configurations with carpet areas ranging from <b>715</b> to <b>1575 sq. ft.</b></div></div></div></div><div data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical" data-slot="accordion-item" class="last:border-b-0 rounded shadow-sm border border-gray-200"><h3 data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed" class="flex"><button type="button" aria-expanded="false" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical" id="radix-«R1umqm6ferb5lb»" data-slot="accordion-trigger" class="focus-visible:border-ring focus-visible:ring-ring/50 flex-1 gap-4 text-left outline-none hover:underline focus-visible:ring-[3px] disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 [&amp;[data-state=open]&gt;svg]:rotate-180 !no-underline bg-[#DEE4EA] hover:brightness-105 transition px-4 py-1.5 text-[#234e70] font-semibold text-[14px] font-sans flex justify-between items-center [&amp;&gt;svg]:text-[#234e70] [&amp;&gt;svg]:w-4 [&amp;&gt;svg]:h-4 rounded-none cursor-pointer" data-radix-collection-item="">What type of parking is available in V Raheja La Serena?<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down text-muted-foreground pointer-events-none size-4 shrink-0 translate-y-0.5 transition-transform duration-200"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></button></h3><div data-state="closed" id="radix-«R5umqm6ferb5lb»" role="region" aria-labelledby="radix-«R1umqm6ferb5lb»" data-orientation="vertical" data-slot="accordion-content" class="overflow-hidden text-sm data-[state=closed]:hidden" style="--radix-accordion-content-height:var(--radix-collapsible-content-height);--radix-accordion-content-width:var(--radix-collapsible-content-width)"><div class="bg-white px-4 py-1.5 text-[12px] md:text-sm font-normal leading-relaxed font-sans text-gray-700"><div>V Raheja La Serena provides dedicated car parking facilities for residents. The exact parking type and the number of spaces allotted per unit are mentioned in the Unit Plan, which you can download for free on the V Raheja La Serena project page on Housiey.</div></div></div></div><div data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical" data-slot="accordion-item" class="last:border-b-0 rounded shadow-sm border border-gray-200"><h3 data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed" class="flex"><button type="button" aria-expanded="false" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical" id="radix-«R22mqm6ferb5lb»" data-slot="accordion-trigger" class="focus-visible:border-ring focus-visible:ring-ring/50 flex-1 gap-4 text-left outline-none hover:underline focus-visible:ring-[3px] disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 [&amp;[data-state=open]&gt;svg]:rotate-180 !no-underline bg-[#DEE4EA] hover:brightness-105 transition px-4 py-1.5 text-[#234e70] font-semibold text-[14px] font-sans flex justify-between items-center [&amp;&gt;svg]:text-[#234e70] [&amp;&gt;svg]:w-4 [&amp;&gt;svg]:h-4 rounded-none cursor-pointer" data-radix-collection-item="">Where is V Raheja La Serena located? What are the nearby landmarks?<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down text-muted-foreground pointer-events-none size-4 shrink-0 translate-y-0.5 transition-transform duration-200"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></button></h3><div data-state="closed" id="radix-«R62mqm6ferb5lb»" role="region" aria-labelledby="radix-«R22mqm6ferb5lb»" data-orientation="vertical" data-slot="accordion-content" class="overflow-hidden text-sm data-[state=closed]:hidden" style="--radix-accordion-content-height:var(--radix-collapsible-content-height);--radix-accordion-content-width:var(--radix-collapsible-content-width)"><div class="bg-white px-4 py-1.5 text-[12px] md:text-sm font-normal leading-relaxed font-sans text-gray-700"><div>It is located at <b>Off M.G. road, Patel Nagar, Kandivali West, Mumbai</b>.<br>Nearby landmarks include:<br><b>• Kandivali Railway Station - 1.0km </b><br><b>• DMart - 1.5km </b><br><b>• Dahanukarwadi Metro Station - 1.6km </b></div></div></div></div><div data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical" data-slot="accordion-item" class="last:border-b-0 rounded shadow-sm border border-gray-200"><h3 data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed" class="flex"><button type="button" aria-expanded="false" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical" id="radix-«R26mqm6ferb5lb»" data-slot="accordion-trigger" class="focus-visible:border-ring focus-visible:ring-ring/50 flex-1 gap-4 text-left outline-none hover:underline focus-visible:ring-[3px] disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 [&amp;[data-state=open]&gt;svg]:rotate-180 !no-underline bg-[#DEE4EA] hover:brightness-105 transition px-4 py-1.5 text-[#234e70] font-semibold text-[14px] font-sans flex justify-between items-center [&amp;&gt;svg]:text-[#234e70] [&amp;&gt;svg]:w-4 [&amp;&gt;svg]:h-4 rounded-none cursor-pointer" data-radix-collection-item="">What payment plans are available for V Raheja La Serena?<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down text-muted-foreground pointer-events-none size-4 shrink-0 translate-y-0.5 transition-transform duration-200"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></button></h3><div data-state="closed" id="radix-«R66mqm6ferb5lb»" role="region" aria-labelledby="radix-«R26mqm6ferb5lb»" data-orientation="vertical" data-slot="accordion-content" class="overflow-hidden text-sm data-[state=closed]:hidden" style="--radix-accordion-content-height:var(--radix-collapsible-content-height);--radix-accordion-content-width:var(--radix-collapsible-content-width)"><div class="bg-white px-4 py-1.5 text-[12px] md:text-sm font-normal leading-relaxed font-sans text-gray-700"><div>The following payment plans are available:<br>• <b>CLP ( Construction Link plan)</b> - Regular Standard Slabwise Payment  as per construction, Maximum loan possible up to 90%<br><br><b>Note:</b> In some cases, payment plan deviations can be considered based on your preferred terms. The final schedule is confirmed after your site visit.</div></div></div></div><div data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical" data-slot="accordion-item" class="last:border-b-0 rounded shadow-sm border border-gray-200"><h3 data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed" class="flex"><button type="button" aria-expanded="false" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical" id="radix-«R2amqm6ferb5lb»" data-slot="accordion-trigger" class="focus-visible:border-ring focus-visible:ring-ring/50 flex-1 gap-4 text-left outline-none hover:underline focus-visible:ring-[3px] disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 [&amp;[data-state=open]&gt;svg]:rotate-180 !no-underline bg-[#DEE4EA] hover:brightness-105 transition px-4 py-1.5 text-[#234e70] font-semibold text-[14px] font-sans flex justify-between items-center [&amp;&gt;svg]:text-[#234e70] [&amp;&gt;svg]:w-4 [&amp;&gt;svg]:h-4 rounded-none cursor-pointer" data-radix-collection-item="">What is the minimum down payment required for V Raheja La Serena?<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down text-muted-foreground pointer-events-none size-4 shrink-0 translate-y-0.5 transition-transform duration-200"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></button></h3><div data-state="closed" id="radix-«R6amqm6ferb5lb»" role="region" aria-labelledby="radix-«R2amqm6ferb5lb»" data-orientation="vertical" data-slot="accordion-content" class="overflow-hidden text-sm data-[state=closed]:hidden" style="--radix-accordion-content-height:var(--radix-collapsible-content-height);--radix-accordion-content-width:var(--radix-collapsible-content-width)"><div class="bg-white px-4 py-1.5 text-[12px] md:text-sm font-normal leading-relaxed font-sans text-gray-700"><div>The minimum down payment starts from <b>₹40.00 Lacs</b>, inclusive of all taxes. EMI options are also available. Use the EMI calculator on the project page to check monthly instalments based on your loan amount and tenure.</div></div></div></div><div data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical" data-slot="accordion-item" class="last:border-b-0 rounded shadow-sm border border-gray-200"><h3 data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed" class="flex"><button type="button" aria-expanded="false" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical" id="radix-«R2emqm6ferb5lb»" data-slot="accordion-trigger" class="focus-visible:border-ring focus-visible:ring-ring/50 flex-1 gap-4 text-left outline-none hover:underline focus-visible:ring-[3px] disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 [&amp;[data-state=open]&gt;svg]:rotate-180 !no-underline bg-[#DEE4EA] hover:brightness-105 transition px-4 py-1.5 text-[#234e70] font-semibold text-[14px] font-sans flex justify-between items-center [&amp;&gt;svg]:text-[#234e70] [&amp;&gt;svg]:w-4 [&amp;&gt;svg]:h-4 rounded-none cursor-pointer" data-radix-collection-item="">Is V Raheja La Serena approved by banks for home loans?<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down text-muted-foreground pointer-events-none size-4 shrink-0 translate-y-0.5 transition-transform duration-200"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></button></h3><div data-state="closed" id="radix-«R6emqm6ferb5lb»" role="region" aria-labelledby="radix-«R2emqm6ferb5lb»" data-orientation="vertical" data-slot="accordion-content" class="overflow-hidden text-sm data-[state=closed]:hidden" style="--radix-accordion-content-height:var(--radix-collapsible-content-height);--radix-accordion-content-width:var(--radix-collapsible-content-width)"><div class="bg-white px-4 py-1.5 text-[12px] md:text-sm font-normal leading-relaxed font-sans text-gray-700"><div>Yes, it is approved by leading banks including <b>Central Bank of India</b>, <b>Union Bank of India</b>, <b>Bank Of India</b>, <b>Bank Of Baroda</b>, <b>Citi Bank</b>, <b>Kotak Mahindra Bank</b>, <b>Axis Bank</b>, <b>State Bank Of India</b>, <b>ICICI Bank</b>, <b>HDFC BANK</b>. The complete approved bank list is available in the Banks section on Housiey. Home loan eligibility depends on the bank's lending policy and your profile.</div></div></div></div><div data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical" data-slot="accordion-item" class="last:border-b-0 rounded shadow-sm border border-gray-200"><h3 data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed" class="flex"><button type="button" aria-expanded="false" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical" id="radix-«R2imqm6ferb5lb»" data-slot="accordion-trigger" class="focus-visible:border-ring focus-visible:ring-ring/50 flex-1 gap-4 text-left outline-none hover:underline focus-visible:ring-[3px] disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 [&amp;[data-state=open]&gt;svg]:rotate-180 !no-underline bg-[#DEE4EA] hover:brightness-105 transition px-4 py-1.5 text-[#234e70] font-semibold text-[14px] font-sans flex justify-between items-center [&amp;&gt;svg]:text-[#234e70] [&amp;&gt;svg]:w-4 [&amp;&gt;svg]:h-4 rounded-none cursor-pointer" data-radix-collection-item="">Is there any brokerage when buying V Raheja La Serena through Housiey?<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down text-muted-foreground pointer-events-none size-4 shrink-0 translate-y-0.5 transition-transform duration-200"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></button></h3><div data-state="closed" id="radix-«R6imqm6ferb5lb»" role="region" aria-labelledby="radix-«R2imqm6ferb5lb»" data-orientation="vertical" data-slot="accordion-content" class="overflow-hidden text-sm data-[state=closed]:hidden" style="--radix-accordion-content-height:var(--radix-collapsible-content-height);--radix-accordion-content-width:var(--radix-collapsible-content-width)"><div class="bg-white px-4 py-1.5 text-[12px] md:text-sm font-normal leading-relaxed font-sans text-gray-700"><div>No - Housiey follows a strict no-brokerage policy. You pay only the builder's official price - no commission, no hidden charges, and no middlemen. This applies to all projects listed on Housiey.</div></div></div></div><div data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical" data-slot="accordion-item" class="last:border-b-0 rounded shadow-sm border border-gray-200"><h3 data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed" class="flex"><button type="button" aria-expanded="false" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical" id="radix-«R2mmqm6ferb5lb»" data-slot="accordion-trigger" class="focus-visible:border-ring focus-visible:ring-ring/50 flex-1 gap-4 text-left outline-none hover:underline focus-visible:ring-[3px] disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 [&amp;[data-state=open]&gt;svg]:rotate-180 !no-underline bg-[#DEE4EA] hover:brightness-105 transition px-4 py-1.5 text-[#234e70] font-semibold text-[14px] font-sans flex justify-between items-center [&amp;&gt;svg]:text-[#234e70] [&amp;&gt;svg]:w-4 [&amp;&gt;svg]:h-4 rounded-none cursor-pointer" data-radix-collection-item="">Who is the developer of V Raheja La Serena?<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down text-muted-foreground pointer-events-none size-4 shrink-0 translate-y-0.5 transition-transform duration-200"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></button></h3><div data-state="closed" id="radix-«R6mmqm6ferb5lb»" role="region" aria-labelledby="radix-«R2mmqm6ferb5lb»" data-orientation="vertical" data-slot="accordion-content" class="overflow-hidden text-sm data-[state=closed]:hidden" style="--radix-accordion-content-height:var(--radix-collapsible-content-height);--radix-accordion-content-width:var(--radix-collapsible-content-width)"><div class="bg-white px-4 py-1.5 text-[12px] md:text-sm font-normal leading-relaxed font-sans text-gray-700"><div>It is developed by <b>V Raheja Realty</b>, a trusted real estate brand with over <b>48 years</b> of experience and more than <b>100 completed projects</b> across <b>Bangalore Rural, Bangalore Urban, Mumbai City and Mumbai suburban</b>. </div></div></div></div><div data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical" data-slot="accordion-item" class="last:border-b-0 rounded shadow-sm border border-gray-200"><h3 data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed" class="flex"><button type="button" aria-expanded="false" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical" id="radix-«R2qmqm6ferb5lb»" data-slot="accordion-trigger" class="focus-visible:border-ring focus-visible:ring-ring/50 flex-1 gap-4 text-left outline-none hover:underline focus-visible:ring-[3px] disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 [&amp;[data-state=open]&gt;svg]:rotate-180 !no-underline bg-[#DEE4EA] hover:brightness-105 transition px-4 py-1.5 text-[#234e70] font-semibold text-[14px] font-sans flex justify-between items-center [&amp;&gt;svg]:text-[#234e70] [&amp;&gt;svg]:w-4 [&amp;&gt;svg]:h-4 rounded-none cursor-pointer" data-radix-collection-item="">Does V Raheja La Serena have CC and OC approvals?<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down text-muted-foreground pointer-events-none size-4 shrink-0 translate-y-0.5 transition-transform duration-200"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></button></h3><div data-state="closed" id="radix-«R6qmqm6ferb5lb»" role="region" aria-labelledby="radix-«R2qmqm6ferb5lb»" data-orientation="vertical" data-slot="accordion-content" class="overflow-hidden text-sm data-[state=closed]:hidden" style="--radix-accordion-content-height:var(--radix-collapsible-content-height);--radix-accordion-content-width:var(--radix-collapsible-content-width)"><div class="bg-white px-4 py-1.5 text-[12px] md:text-sm font-normal leading-relaxed font-sans text-gray-700"><div>The Commencement Certificate is available. The <b>Occupancy Certificate (OC)</b> will be applied for closer to the possession date, as per standard regulatory timelines. All currently available documents are listed in the Documents section on Housiey.</div></div></div></div><div data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical" data-slot="accordion-item" class="last:border-b-0 rounded shadow-sm border border-gray-200"><h3 data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed" class="flex"><button type="button" aria-expanded="false" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical" id="radix-«R2umqm6ferb5lb»" data-slot="accordion-trigger" class="focus-visible:border-ring focus-visible:ring-ring/50 flex-1 gap-4 text-left outline-none hover:underline focus-visible:ring-[3px] disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 [&amp;[data-state=open]&gt;svg]:rotate-180 !no-underline bg-[#DEE4EA] hover:brightness-105 transition px-4 py-1.5 text-[#234e70] font-semibold text-[14px] font-sans flex justify-between items-center [&amp;&gt;svg]:text-[#234e70] [&amp;&gt;svg]:w-4 [&amp;&gt;svg]:h-4 rounded-none cursor-pointer" data-radix-collection-item="">Can I book a site visit for V Raheja La Serena?<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down text-muted-foreground pointer-events-none size-4 shrink-0 translate-y-0.5 transition-transform duration-200"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></button></h3><div data-state="closed" id="radix-«R6umqm6ferb5lb»" role="region" aria-labelledby="radix-«R2umqm6ferb5lb»" data-orientation="vertical" data-slot="accordion-content" class="overflow-hidden text-sm data-[state=closed]:hidden" style="--radix-accordion-content-height:var(--radix-collapsible-content-height);--radix-accordion-content-width:var(--radix-collapsible-content-width)"><div class="bg-white px-4 py-1.5 text-[12px] md:text-sm font-normal leading-relaxed font-sans text-gray-700"><div>Yes - book a free site visit through Housiey. We arrange a free Ola cab pickup and drop from your location.<br><br>Alternatively, you can schedule an online project presentation directly by the builder from home. Both options are 100% free with no obligation to buy.</div></div></div></div><div data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical" data-slot="accordion-item" class="last:border-b-0 rounded shadow-sm border border-gray-200"><h3 data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed" class="flex"><button type="button" aria-expanded="false" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical" id="radix-«R32mqm6ferb5lb»" data-slot="accordion-trigger" class="focus-visible:border-ring focus-visible:ring-ring/50 flex-1 gap-4 text-left outline-none hover:underline focus-visible:ring-[3px] disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 [&amp;[data-state=open]&gt;svg]:rotate-180 !no-underline bg-[#DEE4EA] hover:brightness-105 transition px-4 py-1.5 text-[#234e70] font-semibold text-[14px] font-sans flex justify-between items-center [&amp;&gt;svg]:text-[#234e70] [&amp;&gt;svg]:w-4 [&amp;&gt;svg]:h-4 rounded-none cursor-pointer" data-radix-collection-item="">Can NRIs buy a flat in V Raheja La Serena?<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down text-muted-foreground pointer-events-none size-4 shrink-0 translate-y-0.5 transition-transform duration-200"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></button></h3><div data-state="closed" id="radix-«R72mqm6ferb5lb»" role="region" aria-labelledby="radix-«R32mqm6ferb5lb»" data-orientation="vertical" data-slot="accordion-content" class="overflow-hidden text-sm data-[state=closed]:hidden" style="--radix-accordion-content-height:var(--radix-collapsible-content-height);--radix-accordion-content-width:var(--radix-collapsible-content-width)"><div class="bg-white px-4 py-1.5 text-[12px] md:text-sm font-normal leading-relaxed font-sans text-gray-700"><div>Yes - NRIs can purchase this project under FEMA regulations. Payment can be made via NRE or NRO accounts. Home loans are available from Indian banks with a co-applicant. Housiey's team assists NRI buyers with documentation and Power of Attorney requirements remotely - 100% free.</div></div></div></div><div data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical" data-slot="accordion-item" class="last:border-b-0 rounded shadow-sm border border-gray-200"><h3 data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed" class="flex"><button type="button" aria-expanded="false" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical" id="radix-«R36mqm6ferb5lb»" data-slot="accordion-trigger" class="focus-visible:border-ring focus-visible:ring-ring/50 flex-1 gap-4 text-left outline-none hover:underline focus-visible:ring-[3px] disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 [&amp;[data-state=open]&gt;svg]:rotate-180 !no-underline bg-[#DEE4EA] hover:brightness-105 transition px-4 py-1.5 text-[#234e70] font-semibold text-[14px] font-sans flex justify-between items-center [&amp;&gt;svg]:text-[#234e70] [&amp;&gt;svg]:w-4 [&amp;&gt;svg]:h-4 rounded-none cursor-pointer" data-radix-collection-item="">Why is V Raheja La Serena considered a good investment?<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down text-muted-foreground pointer-events-none size-4 shrink-0 translate-y-0.5 transition-transform duration-200"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></button></h3><div data-state="closed" id="radix-«R76mqm6ferb5lb»" role="region" aria-labelledby="radix-«R36mqm6ferb5lb»" data-orientation="vertical" data-slot="accordion-content" class="overflow-hidden text-sm data-[state=closed]:hidden" style="--radix-accordion-content-height:var(--radix-collapsible-content-height);--radix-accordion-content-width:var(--radix-collapsible-content-width)"><div class="bg-white px-4 py-1.5 text-[12px] md:text-sm font-normal leading-relaxed font-sans text-gray-700"><div><b>Kandivali West</b> is one of Mumbai's sought-after micro-markets with consistent property appreciation.<br><br>This project by <b>V Raheja Realty</b> - with 48 years of experience - offers 2BHK/3BHK/4BHK at ₹2.67 Cr to ₹6.16 Cr, making it a strong long-term investment opportunity.</div></div></div></div><div data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical" data-slot="accordion-item" class="last:border-b-0 rounded shadow-sm border border-gray-200"><h3 data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed" class="flex"><button type="button" aria-expanded="false" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical" id="radix-«R3amqm6ferb5lb»" data-slot="accordion-trigger" class="focus-visible:border-ring focus-visible:ring-ring/50 flex-1 gap-4 text-left outline-none hover:underline focus-visible:ring-[3px] disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 [&amp;[data-state=open]&gt;svg]:rotate-180 !no-underline bg-[#DEE4EA] hover:brightness-105 transition px-4 py-1.5 text-[#234e70] font-semibold text-[14px] font-sans flex justify-between items-center [&amp;&gt;svg]:text-[#234e70] [&amp;&gt;svg]:w-4 [&amp;&gt;svg]:h-4 rounded-none cursor-pointer" data-radix-collection-item="">Why should I buy V Raheja La Serena through Housiey instead of directly from the builder?<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down text-muted-foreground pointer-events-none size-4 shrink-0 translate-y-0.5 transition-transform duration-200"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></button></h3><div data-state="closed" id="radix-«R7amqm6ferb5lb»" role="region" aria-labelledby="radix-«R3amqm6ferb5lb»" data-orientation="vertical" data-slot="accordion-content" class="overflow-hidden text-sm data-[state=closed]:hidden" style="--radix-accordion-content-height:var(--radix-collapsible-content-height);--radix-accordion-content-width:var(--radix-collapsible-content-width)"><div class="bg-white px-4 py-1.5 text-[12px] md:text-sm font-normal leading-relaxed font-sans text-gray-700"><div>Buying through Housiey gives you:<br>(1) No brokerage - you pay the builder's exact price<br>(2) Free Ola cab site visit<br>(3) Online project presentation by the builder from home<br>(4) Free legal consultation via Housiey Legal<br>(5) Honest Pros & Cons review on every project<br>All services are 100% free with no obligation.</div></div></div></div><div data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical" data-slot="accordion-item" class="last:border-b-0 rounded shadow-sm border border-gray-200"><h3 data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed" class="flex"><button type="button" aria-expanded="false" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical" id="radix-«R3emqm6ferb5lb»" data-slot="accordion-trigger" class="focus-visible:border-ring focus-visible:ring-ring/50 flex-1 gap-4 text-left outline-none hover:underline focus-visible:ring-[3px] disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 [&amp;[data-state=open]&gt;svg]:rotate-180 !no-underline bg-[#DEE4EA] hover:brightness-105 transition px-4 py-1.5 text-[#234e70] font-semibold text-[14px] font-sans flex justify-between items-center [&amp;&gt;svg]:text-[#234e70] [&amp;&gt;svg]:w-4 [&amp;&gt;svg]:h-4 rounded-none cursor-pointer" data-radix-collection-item="">How can I download the price sheet or brochure of V Raheja La Serena?<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down text-muted-foreground pointer-events-none size-4 shrink-0 translate-y-0.5 transition-transform duration-200"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></button></h3><div data-state="closed" id="radix-«R7emqm6ferb5lb»" role="region" aria-labelledby="radix-«R3emqm6ferb5lb»" data-orientation="vertical" data-slot="accordion-content" class="overflow-hidden text-sm data-[state=closed]:hidden" style="--radix-accordion-content-height:var(--radix-collapsible-content-height);--radix-accordion-content-width:var(--radix-collapsible-content-width)"><div class="bg-white px-4 py-1.5 text-[12px] md:text-sm font-normal leading-relaxed font-sans text-gray-700"><div>The price sheet and brochure for this project are available for free download on Housiey. Click the "Price Sheet" or "Brochure" button on the project page. No registration is required for instant download.</div></div></div></div><div data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical" data-slot="accordion-item" class="last:border-b-0 rounded shadow-sm border border-gray-200"><h3 data-orientation="vertical" data-state="closed" class="flex"><button type="button" aria-expanded="false" data-state="closed" data-orientation="vertical" id="radix-«R3imqm6ferb5lb»" data-slot="accordion-trigger" class="focus-visible:border-ring focus-visible:ring-ring/50 flex-1 gap-4